# --- OneDrive note -----------------------------------------------------------
# This project lives inside a OneDrive-synced folder. OneDrive syncing .next
# (a 100MB+ cache that churns on every dev rebuild) makes `next dev` slow and
# can lock files mid-build. .gitignore does NOT stop OneDrive — to stop it,
# right-click the .next and node_modules folders -> "Always keep off this
# device" / "Free up space", or move the project out of OneDrive entirely.
# See README -> "If the dev server feels slow".
